    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests how {@link StrSubstitutor} applies a \"default value\" to a variable that cannot be resolved from the value map. <p> In each scenario the template references two known variables ({@code animal}, {@code target}) plus one unknown variable ({@code undefined.number}). The unknown variable carries an inline default value that is separated from the variable name by the configured <em>value delimiter</em>. When the delimiter is recognized the default value is substituted; when it is not, the whole variable reference is left untouched."
   },
